# Copy this to 96_Obsidian_Structure/.gitignore before the first commit.
#
# workspace.json records which panes are open and changes on every focus
# change. Tracking it means a merge conflict every time the desktop and the
# phone are used on the same day, over information that carries no meaning.
# The rest of .obsidian stays tracked, so plugin settings and the templates
# folder follow the vault.

.DS_Store
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.trash/

# Plugin code is ~1.2 MB per bundle and is re-committed in full on every update.
# Git never forgets a blob, and this repo also has to carry photos. The
# manifests stay tracked, so it stays visible which plugins the vault expects.
.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css
